# 100 - aegis-glass-sheets (mobile M3)
# AegisGlassSheet base: bottom panel in the dock's glass recipe,
# 380 ms rise, 75%-height cap with an internal scroll, scrim tap +
# downward-fling dismiss. AegisMenuSheet: page-context header
# (domain + hardened pill) over a 4x2 quick-action grid that reuses
# the browser's menu action ids. AegisTabGridSheet: two-column tab
